			"notes": "## 0.5.4.5\n**ACTUALLY ACTUALLY** final patch for 0.5.4\n\n#### Changes:\n- Reactions rebalanced so that they no longer blow stuff up\n- Configurable Duct volume\n- Minor balloon changes and bug fixes\n- Flint and steel dispensers can activate sugar rockets\n- CC'able gas nozzle (thanks Agarmal)\n- Exhaust particle isn't generic anymore\n- Redstone Resistor reverted mode\n\n#### Bugfixes:\n- Crash with assemblers due to new VS2\n- Gas nozzle not saving valve pointer value (thanks Agarmal)\n- Phys bearing angle follower mode \n- Client log spam"
